---
import { personal } from '../data/personal';
import '../styles/personal.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<div class="personal-content">
  <nav class="chapter-nav" aria-label="About page sections"><span>GET TO KNOW ME</span><a href="#story">My story</a><a href="#strengths">Strengths</a><a href="#leadership">Involvement</a><a href="#people">My people</a><a href="#hobbies">Little joys</a></nav>
  <section class="personal-section story-grid" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE PROFILE</p><h2 id="story-title">My story.<br/><span class="blue">Still being written.</span></h2>{personal.story.map(paragraph => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}<p class="personal-motto">Keep learning. Stay grounded. Make it meaningful.</p></div><aside class="goal-card"><span class="big-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</span><p class="eyebrow">WHAT I’M WORKING TOWARD</p><h3>A meaningful life,<br/>on my own terms.</h3><p>{personal.goal}</p><span class="goal-footnote">ONE DAY, ONE STEP AT A TIME ↗</span></aside></section>
  <section class="personal-section" id="strengths" aria-labelledby="strengths-title"><div class="personal-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / ALWAYS A WORK IN PROGRESS</p><h2 id="strengths-title">What I bring <span class="blue">with me.</span></h2></div><p>Skills I practice.<br/>Values I keep coming back to.</p></div><div class="strength-grid">{personal.strengths.map((strength, index) => <article><span class="strength-number">0{index + 1}</span><h3>{strength.title}</h3><p>{strength.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="personal-section" id="leadership" aria-labelledby="leadership-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / INVOLVEMENT & GROWTH</p><h2 id="leadership-title">A part of <span class="blue">something bigger.</span></h2><div class="leadership-card"><div><span class="outline-tag">COMMUNITY & TEAMWORK</span><h3>Learning to lead<br/>by showing up.</h3><p>I want to become someone others can depend on. Listening, sharing responsibilities, and contributing with care are habits I aim to develop throughout my student journey.</p><p class="personal-motto">A goal to practice: show up, listen, and contribute.</p></div><div class="memory-photo group-photo"><img src={`${base}/images/caloy2.jpg`} alt="Students learning together around a classroom table" loading="lazy" /><span class="photo-label">LEARNING TOGETHER / 01</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="personal-section" id="people" aria-labelledby="people-title"><div class="personal-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / MY PEOPLE</p><h2 id="people-title">A full life.<br/><span class="blue">A close circle.</span></h2></div><p>The people behind the memories.<br/>The moments that mean the most.</p></div><div class="people-grid">{personal.people.map((person) => {  return <article class="people-card"><div class="memory-photo"><img src={`${base}/images/${person.image}`} alt={person.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="photo-label">{person.caption}</span></div><div class="people-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{person.subtitle}</p><h3>{person.title}</h3><p>{person.text}</p></div></article> })}</div></section>
  <section class="personal-section" id="hobbies" aria-labelledby="hobbies-title"><div class="personal-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / OFF THE CLOCK</p><h2 id="hobbies-title">The things <span class="blue">I enjoy.</span></h2></div><p>A few ways I recharge,<br/>stay curious, and feel like myself.</p></div><div class="hobby-grid">{personal.hobbies.map((hobby, index) => {  return <article><div class:list={['hobby-art', hobby.style]}><img src={`${base}/images/${hobby.image}`} alt={hobby.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><small>0{index + 1} / LITTLE JOYS</small></div><div class="hobby-copy"><h3>{hobby.title}</h3><p>{hobby.text}</p></div></article> })}</div><div class="also-enjoy"><span>AND IN BETWEEN…</span><p>School days, time with friends, and everyday moments give me plenty to look back on and appreciate.</p><span class="blue" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></section>
</div>
